	(descr "Johanson 2450AT07A0100001T 2.4 GHz chip antenna, 1.00 x 0.50 x 0.37 mm (0402), 4 terminals (1 Feed, 2 GND, 3 GND, 4 Feed), mid-edge mount. Pattern from DS Ver 3.1 p2 test board (lands 0.20 x 0.30, 0.3 row gap, 0.1 column slot; GND strip along the edge; feed tongue), moved 0.20 mm inward for the 0.30 mm pad-to-edge rule. Place with the Dwgs.User EDGE line ON the board outline (body long axis perpendicular to the edge). Keep-out WIFI_ANT_KEEPOUT 5.0 x 3.2 mm on every copper layer, no parts on either side. Pi matching network (3x 0201, shunt-series-shunt) at the tongue, outside the keep-out. https://www.johansontechnology.com/datasheets/antennas/2450AT07A0100.pdf")
	(tags "antenna chip 2.4GHz WiFi Bluetooth ISM Johanson 2450AT07A0100 0402 ELRS")
